// How sothrone is built: `compiler\Mara.exe build` (build.bat) builds the
// one named as the folder. Its modules are all in this folder for now; the
// ones shared with the other ports (C:\Code\project_og.md) may move to a
// folder of their own, named in dirs.
module build

use mara.build

sothrone :: Build(){release = true}
